---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import before from '@assets/before.jpeg';
import after from '@assets/after.jpeg';
import alleFire from '@assets/alle_fire.jpg';
import klem from '@assets/klem.jpg';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 pb-24">

    <!-- Page header -->
    <section class="pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-16 reveal">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 mb-8 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container rounded-full font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary inline-block"></span>
        Gudbrandsdalen, Norway
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-7xl italic text-primary leading-tight mb-6">
        How we got here
      </h1>
      <div class="w-16 h-px bg-secondary/40 mb-6"></div>
      <p class="font-body text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        We're four friends turning an old forge into a chapel. Here's the full story.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story content card -->
    <article class="bg-surface-bright/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-on-surface/8 overflow-hidden reveal reveal-delay-1">

      <!-- The forge section -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border-b border-on-surface/8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl">local_fire_department</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl italic text-primary leading-snug">The building</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-custom space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Ledum Farm sits in a fold of Gudbrandsdalen, and for generations its forge — <em>smia</em> in Norwegian — was the place farmers brought broken things to be fixed. The fire stayed lit. The work kept coming.
          </p>
          <p>
            Then it didn't. Slowly, over a few decades, the forge fell quiet. By the time we found it, the stone walls were still standing — solid, actually — but the place had been empty for years. It didn't feel ruined. It just felt like it was waiting.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- The vision section -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border-b border-on-surface/8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl">lightbulb</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl italic text-primary leading-snug">Mathias's idea</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Mathias grew up in the valley. He'd heard about the forge his whole life, but the first time he walked inside as an adult — cold stone, dusty light, the faint smell of old iron — he had a specific thought: this should be a chapel.
          </p>
          <p>
            Not a heritage project. Not a museum. Just a small, quiet room where anyone could come to sit and think. No entry fee, no membership, no particular religion required. Just a place.
          </p>
          <p>
            He called three of us and explained what he was thinking. We said yes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- The four section -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border-b border-on-surface/8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl">group</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl italic text-primary leading-snug">The four of us</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We all grew up in or around Gudbrandsdalen. We know each other from school, from church, from the way you just know people when you're from the same valley. On a grey autumn afternoon, the four of us stood in the old forge and listened to Mathias.
          </p>
          <p>
            None of us are architects. None of us are professional builders. But we all knew what we were getting into — weekends, holidays, a lot of learning on the job — and we wanted to do it anyway.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <Image src={alleFire} alt="The four friends building the chapel" class="w-full h-48 md:h-64 object-cover" />
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <Image src={klem} alt="A moment along the way" class="w-full h-48 md:h-64 object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- The work section -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border-b border-on-surface/8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl">construction</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl italic text-primary leading-snug">What we've done so far</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We started with rubble. We now have walls, a repaired roof, and a real sense of what the room is going to feel like. There's still a lot left — the windows need finishing, the floor needs laying, and there are a hundred small things that turn a shell into a room you'd actually want to sit in.
          </p>
          <p>
            We've given up a lot of weekends and holidays for this. We've made mistakes and fixed them. The weather has been rough, and the stone has been rougher. But we're still here, and so are the walls.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Before/after images -->
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <Image src={before} alt="The forge before renovation" class="w-full h-40 md:h-56 object-cover" />
            <p class="text-xs font-label text-on-surface-variant mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Before</p>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <Image src={after} alt="The chapel taking shape" class="w-full h-40 md:h-56 object-cover" />
            <p class="text-xs font-label text-on-surface-variant mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">After</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What it will become -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border-b border-on-surface/8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl">church</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl italic text-primary leading-snug">What it'll be</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We're calling it Capella Reginae Norvegiae — the Chapel of the Queen of Norway. It'll be small, non-denominational, and open to everyone. No entry fee, no membership, nothing required of you. Just come in if you need a quiet moment.
          </p>
          <p>
            We're planning stained glass, simple wooden seating, and the kind of light that only comes through stone walls. It'll sit in the valley the way the forge always did — quietly, and for a long time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
        <p class="font-headline italic text-2xl text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">We're not done yet — and we could use your help.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto">
          We're raising 400,000 kr to finish the chapel. Every contribution goes straight to the building — no overhead, no admin, just four people and a stone room.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            target="_blank"
            href="https://www.spleis.no/project/485151?s=c"
            class="btn-pulse inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-3.5 rounded-sm font-label text-sm hover:bg-primary/90 shadow-lg transition-colors tracking-wide"
          >
            Support the chapel
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">favorite</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/capellareginaenorvegiae/en"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 border border-primary/30 text-primary rounded-sm font-label text-sm hover:bg-primary/5 transition-colors tracking-wide"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_back</span>
            Back to home
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </article>

  </main>
</Layout>
